        en("I appreciate the consistency. You're the first delegation this year to say the uncomfortable part out loud. So — if we're limited-risk, I want protection: a floor. Never below two per cent, even in a crisis.", '我欣賞這份一致。你們是今年第一個把不舒服的部分說出口的代表團。所以——如果我們是有限風險，我要保障：一個下限。就算危機時，也不低於 2%。')
